    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

-- src:1533 | 3. Fines imposed in accordance with this Article shall be effective, proportionate and dissuasive.
@ref Art 101(3) (src:1533)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the fine is effective` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fine is proportionate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fine is dissuasive` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 101(3) the fine imposed is effective, proportionate and dissuasive` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that nothing is required
    ELSE IF       `the fine is effective`
              AND `the fine is proportionate`
              AND `the fine is dissuasive`
